@startuml "Processus de paiement"

title Processus de paiement

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Stripe API" as Stripe

User -> Frontend: Procéder au paiement
Frontend -> API: POST /api/payments/intent
note right: Body: {orderId}
API -> Auth: Vérifier token
Auth --> API: user verified

API -> PaymentSvc: createPaymentIntent(orderId)
PaymentSvc -> DB: SELECT order WHERE id=? AND userId=?
DB --> PaymentSvc: order data
PaymentSvc -> Stripe: Create Payment Intent
note right: {amount, currency, metadata: {orderId}}
Stripe --> PaymentSvc: {client_secret, payment_intent_id}
PaymentSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (orderId, stripePaymentId, status='pending')
DB --> PaymentSvc: payment created
PaymentSvc --> API: {client_secret, paymentId}
API --> Frontend: payment intent data
Frontend --> User: Formulaire de paiement Stripe

User -> Frontend: Saisir informations carte
Frontend -> Stripe: Confirmer paiement
Stripe --> Frontend: Paiement confirmé
Frontend -> API: POST /api/payments/confirm
note right: Body: {paymentIntentId}

@enduml